			"type": "text",
			"text": "Torukjara was a tapejarid from Rio Parana Formation of Brazil, dating back to Early Cretaceous. Its name comes from 'Toruk' a fictional alien from Avatar(2009) and 'jara' meaning 'lord' in Tupi. It had a wing span about two meters, similar to its close relative Caiuajara alongside the crest that's indicative of tapejarids. Originally Torukjara was thought to be Caiuajara but with a research paper published in 2024 the two got split."
